  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds the optional retained native adapter for exact SOLID/3DFACE, modern level-zero and crease-aware subdivided MESH, and legacy MESH batches, reusing the existing native Mesh3D ABI and canonical Native3D shader. Adds atomic managed/native parity for all nine CAD visual styles through typed render/shading modes and the approved ProGPU-owned bounded three-light shader algorithm. Adds scene-local external IMAGE resources for interned CAD diffuse materials, typed same-device lease acquisition, scalar/opacity/gloss/self-illumination parity, UV transform and Tile/Crop/Clamp addressing, transactional native reference/generation validation, and retained binding invalidation.",
